OL,3,GNEWSAGeneration 'let down' by poor
OL,4,Achildren's services
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren were seriously harmed after
OL,7,Fthey were left in unsafe conditions for
OL,8,Ftoo long by inadequate children's
OL,9,Fsocial care services, inspectors have
OL,10,Ffound.
OL,12,FSlough Children First (SCF), which is
OL,13,Fowned by Slough Borough Council, failed
OL,14,Fto provide the fundamental basics
OL,15,Fconsistently, Ofsted said.
OL,17,FIts performance was found to have
OL,18,Fdeteriorated since a previous
OL,19,Finspection in 2023 and funding "falls
OL,20,Ffar short of what is required to
OL,21,Fadequately resource services", the
OL,22,Fregulator added.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
